stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> begin_owned_savepoint: Caller transaction
    [*] --> read_optional_sources: Autocommit caller
    begin_owned_savepoint --> read_optional_sources: Owned savepoint created
    begin_owned_savepoint --> propagate_error: Savepoint creation fails
    read_optional_sources --> ready: All optional reads succeed
    read_optional_sources --> ready: Request storage absent at discovery
    read_optional_sources --> unavailable_after_rollback: Missing relation, roll back owned scope
    read_optional_sources --> propagate_error: Other error, roll back owned scope
    ready --> release_owned_savepoint: Release owned scope if transactional
    unavailable_after_rollback --> release_owned_savepoint: Release owned scope if transactional
    release_owned_savepoint --> [*]: Return truthful checklist, caller can read deal
    propagate_error --> [*]: Release owned scope if created, throw original error
    %% never Return unavailable with the caller transaction still aborted.
    %% never Roll back or release a caller-owned savepoint.
    %% never Treat permission or unexpected errors as unavailable.
